  "title": "Easy Graham Cracker Cookies",
  "description": "Cookie dough is rolled in graham cracker crumbs and baked into a perfect combination of soft-in-the-middle and crisp-on-the-outside-style cookie.",
  "authors": [
    "lanenickson"
  ],
